step Engineering recipes at 35
  tip Back to an Engineering trainer: Handful of Copper Bolts (from 30, 1s 15c). Also learn Reagent Bot (1s): Forever's Engineering camp item, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. It takes a Handful of Copper Bolts and a Copper Tube, which you learn at 30 and 50, so it gives no points. The Camping 101: Engineering quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an engineering trainer who teaches it free.
  learn 3922
