step Handful of Copper Bolts to 57
  tip Handful of Copper Bolts is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 52, grey 60): about 33 crafts to 57. Each takes 1 Copper Bar. One Copper Bar a craft. Keep the bolts: Practice Locks and later gadgets take them. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmith Hammer is a tool: keep it in your bags.
  craft 3922 until 57

step Engineering recipes at 57
  tip Back to an Engineering trainer: Arclight Spanner (from 50, 1s 50c) and Copper Tube (from 50, 1s 50c).
  learn 7430
