step Copper Tube to 75
  tip Copper Tube is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 Copper Bar and 1 Weak Flux. Two Copper Bars and a Weak Flux a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the Arclight Spanner now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there.
  craft 7430 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 3924 until 75
  skill Engineering 75

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Engineering 75-150

step Journeyman Engineering
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Engineering 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Engineering trainer teaches it: Alliance Finbus Geargrind (Duskwood), Lilliam Sparkspindle (Stormwind City) and Trixie Quikswitch (Ironforge); Horde Franklin Lloyd (Undercity). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Coarse Blasting Powder (from 75, 2s 50c) and Crafted Heavy Shot (from 75, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 5s of recipes and 45s of vendor goods, plus 15 Coarse Stone, 27 Heavy Stone, 72 Copper Bar, 61 Bronze Bar and 2 Silver Bar to gather or buy.
