step Crafted Heavy Shot to 94
  tip Crafted Heavy Shot is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 Coarse Blasting Powder and 1 Copper Bar and makes 200. Make the 15 Coarse Blasting Powder first: it gives points too while not grey. The Coarse Blasting Powder in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor.
  craft 3929 x15
  craft 3930 until 94

