  tip Copper Tube is yellow at 94 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 14 crafts to 100. Each takes 2 Copper Bar and 1 Weak Flux. Two Copper Bars and a Weak Flux a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby.
