step Big Iron Bomb to 210
  tip Big Iron Bomb is yellow at 191 (yellow 190, green 210, grey 230): about 27 crafts to 210. Each takes 3 Iron Bar, 3 Heavy Blasting Powder and 1 Silver Contact and makes 2. Make the 74 Heavy Blasting Powder and 30 Silver Contact (6 crafts) first. Use the 7 Heavy Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. A Silver Bar makes five Silver Contacts (grey by now: no points, but no trip to a vendor either); the Heavy Blasting Powder comes from Heavy Stone. Each craft makes two bombs. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 30, Springspindle Fizzlegear (Ironforge), Lilliam Sparkspindle (Stormwind), Graham Van Talen (Undercity) or Tinkerwiz (Ratchet) sends you to Gnomish Engineering (Tinkmaster Overspark, Ironforge, or Oglethorpe Obnoticus, Booty Bay: 6 Mithril Tubes, an Accurate Scope and 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering (Nixx Sprocketspring, Gadgetzan: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 Solid Dynamite and 5 Explosive Sheep). The Accurate Scope schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3945 x74
