# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Engineering 225-300

step Artisan Engineering
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Engineering 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris); Horde Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 2g 80s of recipes, plus 118 Mithril Bar, 212 Solid Stone, 156 Thorium Bar and 24 Runecloth to gather or buy.
  level 35
  train Engineering Artisan

step Schematic: Thorium Widget
  tip Schematic: Thorium Widget teaches Thorium Widget (Engineering 260) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: Gearcutter Cogspinner (Ironforge), limited stock; Horde: Sovik (Orgrimmar), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 16042 nearest

step Schematic: Thorium Tube
  tip Schematic: Thorium Tube teaches Thorium Tube (Engineering 275) for 1g 60s. Sold by Kor'gar (Riverglades) and Xizzer Fizzbolt (Winterspring), limited stock.
  buy 16047 nearest

step Engineering 225-300: Auction House
