step Runecloth
  tip 24 Runecloth for Thorium Widget: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank.
  collect 14047 x24 anywhere gather levels 45-60

step Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs to 245
  tip Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245. Each takes 1 Mithril Bar and 1 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 50 Solid Blasting Powder first. Use the 12 Solid Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Mithril Bar and one Solid Blasting Powder a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 12585 x50
  craft 12596 until 245

step Engineering recipes at 245
  tip Back to an Engineering trainer: Mithril Gyro-Shot (from 245).
  learn 12621

step Mithril Gyro-Shot to 265
  tip Mithril Gyro-Shot is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265. Each takes 2 Mithril Bar and 2 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 56 Solid Blasting Powder first. Two Mithril Bars and two Solid Blasting Powder a craft. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 12585 x56
  craft 12621 until 265

step Thorium Widget to 287
  tip Thorium Widget is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287. Each takes 3 Thorium Bar and 1 Runecloth. Three Thorium Bars and a Runecloth a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 19791 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19791 until 287

step Thorium Tube to 300
  tip Thorium Tube is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 Thorium Bar. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 19795 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19795 until 300
  skill Engineering 300
